  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Move - A and D

    Shoot - Left or Right Mouse Button

    Aim - Mouse
    Pointer sets which side you shoot(not the directional keys)

    Jump - Space

    Dash/Dodge
    - Left-Shift or Left-Control

    Grenade - G

    Drop Down Platforms - S





    -
    Every third shot is a critical shot, unless you get hit, this you reset the counter.

    -
    Every landed crit gives you 10 CP, you gain 10% critical chance every 100 CP

    -
    You loose all your CP and the critical chance acumulated if you get hit

    -
    Your grenades costs 30 Resources to throw

    - Critical Multiplier and Maximum
    Resources can be upgraded with pickups

    - Every critical hit landed restores
    5 resources

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
